{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>\n\t\t\t中央港澳辦、國務院港澳辦主任夏寶龍上午在深圳調研香港中文大學（深圳）。<br/>\n<br/>\n港澳辦網站指，夏寶龍在聽取校長徐揚生情況介紹後，肯定學校辦學方向，希望學校繼續發揮獨特優勢，更好服務粵港澳大灣區建設。<br/>\n<br/>\n港澳辦分管日常工作的副主任徐啟方，副主任農融，教育局局長蔡若蓮參加上述活動。<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n編輯：鍾慧儀\t\t</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-20T09:04:02.264120+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":141,"images":0,"source":"RTHK 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-20T08:49:18+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-20T16:18:00.520776+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-20T08:57:24.137003+00:00","content_hash":"4403b9d572d56829b93ea07bfa289147a1823fb9a93bc9e4ff0ff68a88e3b6bf","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}